burger\" aria-label=\"القائمة\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div><div class=\"mobile-menu \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><nav class=\"mobile-nav\" aria-label=\"التنقل الرئيسي\"><a class=\"\" href=\"/\">الرئيسية</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/about\">من نحن</a><a class=\"active\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/services\">خدماتنا</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/products\">المنتجات</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/contact\">تواصل معنا</a></nav></div></header><main><!--&--><!--&--><section class=\"TYRMoq_hero\" dir=\"rtl\"><div class=\"TYRMoq_content\"><nav class=\"TYRMoq_crumbs\"><a href=\"/\">الرئيسية</a> / <!-- -->خدماتنا</nav><h1>خدماتنا</h1><p>حلول متكاملة للاستيراد والتوزيع بالجملة</p></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container \"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>خدماتنا</h2></div><ul class=\"_ZLnFa_list\"><li class=\"_ZLnFa_item\"><div class=\"_ZLnFa_media\"><img alt=\"استيراد مواد التنظيف\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"_ZLnFa_img\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/services/inner-cleaning-supplies-01-1254x941.webp\"/><span class=\"_ZLnFa_icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-spray-can\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3h.01\"></path><path d=\"M7 5h.01\"></path><path d=\"M11 7h.01\"></path><path d=\"M3 7h.01\"></path><path d=\"M7 9h.01\"></path><path d=\"M3 11h.01\"></path><rect width=\"4\" height=\"4\" x=\"15\" y=\"5\"></rect><path d=\"m19 9 2 2v10c0 .6-.4 1-1 1h-6c-.6 0-1-.4-1-1V11l2-2\"></path><path d=\"m13 14 8-2\"></path><path d=\"m13 19 8-2\"></path></svg></span></div><h3>استيراد مواد التنظيف</h3><p>منتجات تنظيف عالية الجودة من موردين موثوقين لتلبية احتياجات المحلات والمؤسسات.</p></li><li class=\"_ZLnFa_item\"><div class=\"_ZLnFa_media\"><img alt=\"مناديل ومواد ورقية\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"_ZLnFa_img\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/services/inner-tissues-paper-supplies-02.webp\"/><span class=\"_ZLnFa_icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scroll-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 12h-5\"></path><path d=\"M15 8h-5\"></path><path d=\"M19 17V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 21h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v1a2 2 0 1 1-4 0V5a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3\"></path></svg></span></div><h3>مناديل ومواد ورقية</h3><p>نوفر المناديل الورقية ومواد الاستخدام اليومي بجودة عالية وأسعار مناسبة.</p></li><li class=\"_ZLnFa_item\"><div class=\"_ZLnFa_media\"><img alt=\"توريد أدوات النظافة\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"_ZLnFa_img\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/services/inner-cleaning-tools-03.webp\"/><span class=\"_ZLnFa_icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brush\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m11 10 3 3\"></path><path d=\"M6.5 21A3.5 3.5 0 1 0 3 17.5a2.62 2.62 0 0 1-.708 1.792A1 1 0 0 0 3 21z\"></path><path d=\"M9.969 17.031 21.378 5.624a1 1 0 0 0-3.002-3.002L6.967 14.031\"></path></svg></span></div><h3>توريد أدوات النظافة</h3><p>نوفر المكانس والفرش والجرف وأدوات المسح والتنظيف بجودة جيدة وأسعار مناسبة.</p></li><li class=\"_ZLnFa_item\"><div class=\"_ZLnFa_media\"><img alt=\"التوزيع بالجملة\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"_ZLnFa_img\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/services/inner-bulk-distribution-04.webp\"/><span class=\"_ZLnFa_icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-boxes\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5-4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5 5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5-5-3\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8 7.26 5.15\"></path><path d=\"m12 8 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V8\"></path></svg></span></div><h3>التوزيع بالجملة</h3><p>نورد للمحلات والأسواق في جميع أنحاء ليبيا بكميات تناسب احتياجك.</p></li><li class=\"_ZLnFa_item\"><div class=\"_ZLnFa_media\"><img alt=\"توصيل سريع\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"_ZLnFa_img\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/services/inner-fast-delivery-05.webp\"/><span class=\"_ZLnFa_icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span></div><h3>توصيل سريع</h3><p>نوصل طلباتك في الموعد المحدد إلى محلك أو مخزنك.</p></li><li class=\"_ZLnFa_item\"><div class=\"_ZLnFa_media\"><img alt=\"دعم بعد البيع\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"_ZLnFa_img\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/services/inner-customer-support-06-1254x941.webp\"/><span class=\"_ZLnFa_icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-headset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 11h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5Zm0 0a9 9 0 1 1 18 0m0 0v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3Z\"></path><path d=\"M21 16v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-5\"></path></svg></span></div><h3>دعم بعد البيع</h3><p>نتابع معك حتى استلام الطلب ورضاك الكامل عنه.</p></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"X7kM2G_wrap\"><div class=\"X7kM2G_box\" dir=\"rtl\"><img alt=\"مستلزمات تنظيف\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"X7kM2G_img\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"95vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2Fcleaning-supplies-service.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2Fcleaning-supplies-service.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2Fcleaning-supplies-service.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2Fcleaning-supplies-service.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2Fcleaning-supplies-service.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2Fcleaning-supplies-service.webp&amp;w=1920&amp